---
/** Shown by the player script when the page is served over https:// (ws:// to a LAN server is then blocked). */
---
<div class="https-warning" data-https-warning hidden>
  This page is loaded over HTTPS, so your browser blocks the plain <code>ws://</code> connection to a
  Music Assistant on your network (mixed content). The lab and the docs work here; to connect, serve
  the site over plain <code>http://</code>: <code>git clone</code> the
  <a href="https://github.com/mrdarrengriffin/sendspin-visualiser-concept-js">repository</a> and run
  <code>npm install &amp;&amp; npm run dev</code>, or copy <code>dist/</code> to an http host.
  <a data-http-link href="#" hidden>Try the http:// address of this page</a>.
</div>

<style>
  .https-warning { background: #c33; color: #fff; padding: 10px 16px; font-size: 14px; }
  .https-warning a { color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }
</style>
